{"datasets_out":["real_estate_transactions"],"description":"不動産情報ライブラリ（国土交通省）のXIT001 APIで不動産の取引価格情報を取得し、市区町村×物件種別×四半期の件数と価格中央値を集計、可視化と通知文を作る。成約価格情報については専用の集計・レポートで、取引価格情報と分けて集計し、同じ地域・種別・四半期の中央値同士の比較も行う","name":"reinfolib-tools","steps":{"analyze":"python3 reinfolib_aggregate.py {ax}/data/sources/reinfolib {ax}/derived/reinfolib_quarterly_summary.csv","analyze_pc02":"python3 reinfolib_aggregate_pc02.py {ax}/data/sources/reinfolib/pc02 {ax}/derived/reinfolib_pc02_quarterly_summary.csv","collect":"python3 reinfolib_collect.py {ax}/data/sources/reinfolib --area 13 --from-year 2024 --to-year 2025 --price-classification 01","report":"python3 reinfolib_report.py {ax}/derived/reinfolib_quarterly_summary.csv {ax}/derived/reinfolib_report.html {ax}/derived/reinfolib_notify.txt","report_pc02":"python3 reinfolib_report_pc02.py {ax}/derived/reinfolib_pc02_quarterly_summary.csv {ax}/derived/reinfolib_quarterly_summary.csv {ax}/derived/reinfolib_pc02_report.html {ax}/derived/reinfolib_pc02_notify.txt"},"version":"0.2.0"}